\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2- \highlight22\uc2 Singapore \highlight\uc2  cbank to reveal  \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention \highlight\uc2 , improving transparency\b0\par\par\uc2 432 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Mai 2019\par 04:52\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2019 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 * MAS to release data on \b \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  every 6 months               \par \par \uc2 * $33 bln to be transferred to wealth fund for investments               \par \par \uc2 * MAS has been less transparent than other central banks (Adds reaction)               \par \par \uc2 By Fathin Ungku               \par \par \uc2 SINGAPORE, May 8 (Reuters) - Singapore's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Wednesday it will disclose more information on the actions it takes to implement monetary policy, including releasing data on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  every six months.               \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MAS) \uc2 manages policy through exchange rate settings rather than interest rates, letting the Singapore dollar rise or fall against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  of its main trading partners within an undisclosed policy band.               \par \par \uc2 "MAS has ... decided to disclose further information on its monetary policy \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , without compromising their effectiveness," the MAS said in a statement.               \par \par \uc2 "This further disclosure initiative will provide market participants a better indication of the actions that MAS has undertaken to implement its monetary policy stance."               \par \par \uc2 The first set of data will be for the second half of 2019 and will be released in mid-2020.               \par \par \uc2 The MAS discloses less information than most other major central banks about how it comes to its decisions, including not releasing minutes of its monetary policy meetings, and it only announces policy decisions twice a year.               \par \par \uc2 "It's going to be useful for market watchers," said \uc2 Selena Ling\uc2 , head of treasury research at OCBC bank.               \par \par \uc2 "Net purchases of \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  data alone is not going to give you full clarity but it probably will be a better guide to market understanding of how they run monetary policy over time."               \par \par \uc2 Vishnu Varathan, an economist at \uc2 Mizuho Bank\uc2 , said the MAS could be responding to more global economic concerns.               \par \par \uc2 "Global policy uncertainty is very high, making it more difficult for markets to wrap their heads around where policy is headed," Varathan said.               \par \par \uc2 "(Releasing \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  data) takes away the noise and possible inadvertent consequences of market speculation."               \par \par \uc2 The MAS also said it will be transferring S$45 billion ($33 billion) out of its S$404 billion ($297 billion) in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves to Singapore's sovereign wealth fund GIC for longer-term investments.               \par \par \uc2 "This amount is the excess over what MAS deems necessary to maintain confidence in Singapore's exchange rate-centred monetary policy," the MAS statement said.               \par \par \uc2 The MAS transfers \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the GIC periodically but it has not previously disclosed the amounts.               \par \par \uc2 GIC is among the world's 10 biggest sovereign investors with $390 billion worth of assets, according to the Sovereign Wealth Fund Institute.               \par \par \uc2 Released: 2019-5-8T03:52:59.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020190508ef58006bt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
