engthen further, as the \uc2 Bank of Japan\uc2  might not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  ahead of the Japan-hosted \uc2 Group of Seven\uc2  summit in May.\par \par \uc2 Singapore government\uc2  two-year bond yield rose 0.01 percentage point to 0.88%, while the 10-year yield rose 0.01 percentage point to 1.89%. Bond yields move inversely to their prices.\par \par \uc2 Write to Saurabh Chaturvedi at saurabh.chaturvedi@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 April 12, 2016 07:07 ET (11:07 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020160412ec4c0019s\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
