\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Singapore \highlight\uc2  c.bank denies heavy  \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention \highlight\uc2  to support  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 274 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 April 2015\par 10:47\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2015 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 SINGAPORE\b0 \highlight\uc2 , April 14 (Reuters) - The \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore\uc2  (MAS) on Tuesday denied market talks that it has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  "heavily" to support the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which is the third-worst performing Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year.\par \par \uc2 "These reports had erroneously cited the fall in Singapore's official foreign reserves (OFR) and MAS' \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps since mid-2014 as an indication of heavy \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by MAS to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 Singapore\b0 \highlight\uc2  Dollar Nominal Effective Exchange Rate," the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 The MAS manages monetary policy by letting the Singapore dollar rise or fall against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  of its main trading partners within an undisclosed trading band based on its nominal effective exchange rate (NEER).\par \par \uc2 It said the drop in OFR over the past nine months till end-March 2015 was due to \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  translation effects rather than the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The stock of \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps fell as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  relied more on MAS bills in its money market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and most of the proceeds from the maturing swaps were transferred to the government for management by GIC, Singapore's sovereign wealth fund, over a longer investment period.\par \par \uc2 On Tuesday, the Singapore dollar strengthened to 1.3597 per U.S. dollar after the MAS stayed put on its monetary policy, prompting investors to cut bearish bets on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 It surprised markets by holding off from further monetary easing, saying an improving outlook for global growth would underpin the trade-reliant economy. (Reporting by Jongwoo Cheon and Aradhana Aravindan; Editing by Himani Sarkar) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2015-4-14T09:47:14.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020150414eb4e0097y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
