egional shares continued to rally.\par \par \uc2 Write to Sam Holmes at samuel.holmes@dowjones.com [ 08-08-12 0818GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1163 1859   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020120808e888000pa\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
